  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Damisetti Siva Krishna vs The State Of Andhra Pradesh on 4 November, 2020 Author: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Bench: Cheekati Manavendranath Roy The Hon'Ble Sri Justice Cheekati Manavendranath Roy Criminal Petition No.4964 Of 2020 Order:",
    "facts": "The petitioners are A-1 to A-7 in the above crime. A case under Sections 328, 272 and 273 of the Indian Penal Code, 1860 and under Section 51(i) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 was registered against them.",
    "arguments": "4. Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that this is a covered matter and as per common order passed by this Court dated 05-03-2020 in Criminal Petition Nos.5103 of 2019 and batch, this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] several F.I.Rs registered for the same offences based on identical facts. Therefore, he would submit that the petitioners herein are also similarly placed and they are also entitled for quash of the F.I.R. 5.",
    "petitioner_arguments": "4. Learned counsel for the petitioners would submit that this is a covered matter and as per common order passed by this Court dated 05-03-2020 in Criminal Petition Nos.5103 of 2019 and batch, this Court has [LEAKAGE_MASK] several F.I.Rs registered for the same offences based on identical facts. Therefore, he would submit that the petitioners herein are also similarly placed and they are also entitled for quash of the F.I.R. 5.",
